msgctxt "59\t220"
msgid ""
"In any case, I hope we can move on from\\n"
"this matter both quickly and peaceably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268\t341"
msgid "We should be going, Toma-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344\t379"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "417\t460"
msgid "Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "470\t507"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "523\t652"
msgid ""
"If the Tojo Clan ever does\\n"
"decide to come for my land..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "661\t743"
msgid "Just give me a heads up first, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "762\t883"
msgid ""
"Those kids depend on me\\n"
"as they would their actual father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "886\t933"
msgid "I understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "942\t1010"
msgid "But you needn't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012\t1151"
msgid ""
"As long as I'm chairman,\\n"
"the Tojo will stay far away from Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156\t1201"
msgid "You promise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204\t1243"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1267\t1369"
msgid ""
"I'm well aware of how\\n"
"resilient you are, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1371\t1483"
msgid ""
"Incurring your wrath would\\n"
"likely be the last thing I did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1521\t1671"
msgid ""
"Toma-kun's dream for Okinawa can wait\\n"
"until he himself becomes prime minister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1673\t1725"
msgid "Right, Toma-kun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776\t1886"
msgid "You'll be an old man by then, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1888\t2022"
msgid ""
"And those children of yours will be\\n"
"about the same age I am now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2024\t2083"
msgid "Maybe then things will be different."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2103\t2186"
msgid "I still won't be a pushover."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2224\t2269"
msgid "I expect not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2315\t2431"
msgid "Until next time, Fourth Chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2448\t2488"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2826\t2869"
msgid "Mind if I ask you somethin'?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2871\t2925"
msgid "Hm? What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2927\t3113"
msgid ""
"By, uh... By fourth chairman...\\n"
"He didn't mean of the Tojo Clan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3116\t3180"
msgid "Did he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3183\t3243"
msgid "And if he did?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3280\t3436"
msgid ""
"You're shittin' me! Everyone who's anyone's\\n"
"heard the legends of the fourth chairman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3450\t3528"
msgid "The Dragon of Dojima, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3594\t3676"
msgid "Then you're... Kiryu!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3678\t3782"
msgid "Next time you pick a fight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3783\t3915"
msgid ""
"You might wanna do a little\\n"
"more research first, brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3954\t4106"
msgid ""
"Look at me, swearin' an oath with\\n"
"the biggest fish in the yakuza sea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4112\t4203"
msgid ""
"Guess you never know\\n"
"what life'll throw at you."
msgstr ""